  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id="HH3753C2D0F64441EEC1CB77241E2239DC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;5. New compression and interconnect facilities on GPPL&amp;#x2019;s system approved in CP21-1-000 and CP21-458-000 were placed in service December 1st, 2025. The completed facilities include compression and an interconnect with Gulf Run Transmission at MP69 along with upgrades to the interconnects with Transco pipeline and Tennessee. MP33 includes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; compression plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;high-pressure and low-pressure interconnects with Golden Triangle Storage.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
