  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="HHE60759687E403C6B3DE58B8464A791E0" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;11.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; Effective December 1, 2025, the Company implemented revised recourse transportation rates pursuant to its FERC Gas Tariff. The revision increased the firm transportation (FT) reservation rate from $1.5882 to $3.2881 per &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Dth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; per month and established a Fuel Balancing Optimization (FBO) charge of $0.2997 per &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Dth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; per month applicable to firm transportation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;service.Based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; on current contracted quantities and projected billing determinants, the Company estimates the revised FT reservation rate and FBO charge will result in an approximate annual increase in transportation revenues of $56 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;million.The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; tariff revision also increased the interruptible transportation (IT) recourse rate from $0.0522 to $0.1081 per&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Dth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;. The Company estimates the resulting change in annual revenues associated with the IT rate adjustment to be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;immaterial.The&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; revised tariff rates apply to approximately 30&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;firm&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;and interruptible transportation customers.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:12pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
