&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="5" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 13.76pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid; padding-left: 4.24pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;&lt;span style="-aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;NOTES PAYABLE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;In 2021, the Company entered into an agreement with Golden Triangle Storage, Inc. (&amp;#8220;GTS&amp;#8221;) to reimburse GTS for construction costs associated with the GTS interconnection facilities near Vidor, TX at Milepost 33 (&amp;#8220;MP33&amp;#8221;). The reimbursable costs, capped at $29 million, were financed in 2024 through notes payable to GTS at 7.11% interest per annum, along with monthly amortizing payments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Payments began in July 2024 upon completion of construction on the principal amount of $28.2 million for the original term ending on June 30, 2034. The reimbursement agreement also allowed for early payoff without premium or penalty. In September 2025, the Company elected to settle all outstanding amounts with GTS by making a final payoff of $27.2 million. As a result of the debt extinguishment, the Company recognized no gain or loss, and capitalized an additional $0.8 million of GTS completion costs. Interest Paid in 2025 was $1.4 million.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="6" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 14.01pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid; padding-left: 7.59pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;&amp;#160;OTHER REGULATORY ASSETS AND LIABILITIES&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
