&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="7" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 14.01pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid; padding-left: 7.59pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;COMMITMENTS AND CONTINGENCIES&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;GPPL has various future contractual commitments under executed contracts, including performance bonds, which do not meet the definition of a liability as of December 31, 2025; thus, they are not recognized as liabilities in our Financial Statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Legal Proceedings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The Company is not currently involved as a party to any legal proceedings. However, the contractor for a portion of the construction project is claiming additional amounts for work performed. The Company disputes the amounts claimed and is currently engaged with the contractor to resolve the dispute. The Company recognizes legal costs in connection with legal and regulatory matters as incurred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Environmental and Regulatory Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.6pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;Golden Pass Pipeline and its facilities are subject to extensive regulation under federal, state and local statutes, rules, regulations and laws. These laws require the Company to engage in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;consultations with appropriate federal and state agencies and to obtain and maintain applicable permits and other authorizations. Failure to comply with such laws could result in legal proceedings, which may include substantial penalties. The Company currently does not have environmental violations or other regulatory matters that would have a material effect on its financial condition, results of operations or cash flows. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol style="margin: 0pt; padding-left: 0pt;" start="8" type="1"&gt;
&lt;li style="margin-left: 14.01pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; page-break-after: avoid; padding-left: 7.59pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase;"&gt;TRANSACTIONS WITH ASSOCIATED COMPANIES&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
