      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Amended to reflect 50 Year Depreciable life (2% Depreciation Rate) as approved by FERC to correct an error through the use of Account 439 Adjustments to Retained Earnings. See Note 2 - Summary of Significant Accounting Policies for more details.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH3824D4B5A212351AEFD29FC23C348131" xlink:to="HHCEB6A7F9AA083BEFE5D02D7BC6F8C36B" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH31A189B7DF4AEDCEB048932595325850" xlink:label="HH31A189B7DF4AEDCEB048932595325850" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH495018F39FB1EF7CECFDCBD19D9586DD" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Effective July 1, 2019, GPPL began amortizing the Regulatory Asset, created in accordance with the Commission's Order per Docket No. CP11-34, pursuant to the Order Approving Settlement issued June 14, 2019 under Docket No. RP19-1219-000. The Regulatory Asset will be amortized over a 50-year period commencing July 1, 2019.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH31A189B7DF4AEDCEB048932595325850" xlink:to="HH495018F39FB1EF7CECFDCBD19D9586DD" order="1" />
