    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH80D20148FDF9761D7CBD2ECB211E1EE1" xlink:to="HH7C0807075479FBA826D3276CE57BDB86" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH02F7BC6045DABD3356F111F80FE64C83" xlink:label="HH02F7BC6045DABD3356F111F80FE64C83" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC280DC90299DDC37DD96293136897D07" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>GPLNG is required to make monthly reservation payments to the Company for the contracted reserved capacity under GPPL&#8217;s FERC Gas Tariff. Total related-party transportation capacity charges of $36.2 million and $12.2 million are included in transportation revenue in the Statements of Operations for the years ended December 31, 2025, and 2024, respectively.&#160;</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH02F7BC6045DABD3356F111F80FE64C83" xlink:to="HHC280DC90299DDC37DD96293136897D07" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHFEB4C7A226CAECD54DF7F4548292902B" xlink:label="HHFEB4C7A226CAECD54DF7F4548292902B" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE160A508DF06D642084CBFF894CE0DB5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>GPPL has no storage facilities, gas withdrawn from system in operational activities.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFEB4C7A226CAECD54DF7F4548292902B" xlink:to="HHE160A508DF06D642084CBFF894CE0DB5" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHFF005D0804688668D3D963A3701F25AA" xlink:label="HHFF005D0804688668D3D963A3701F25AA" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH0F3F25D2A761F6CA6D320C8876694F3C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>GPPL has no storage facilities, gas injected into system in operational activities.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
